# TierCard on DemoPage

- Demo lives in `TierCardsDemo.vue` only.
- Prefer `<TierCard variant="standardClaim" />` (presets built inside `TierCard.vue` with assetMap + `tierCard.*` i18n).
- Real pages still pass `:tier="…"` (e.g. PlanPage).
- Show Code must stay short and pasteable — do not dump full theme/footer objects into snippets.
- No hardcoded user-facing copy; no `demo.` keys inside Show Code.
